  "summary": "Malicious code in @bobfrankston/mailx-sync (npm)",
  "details": "Package @bobfrankston/mailx-sync@0.1.28 depends on @bobfrankston/iflow-direct (a previously-confirmed malicious package that has been removed from the registry) and @bobfrankston/tcp-transport. The package ships mail provider implementations (Gmail API, Outlook Graph, IMAP) with no install scripts in this version, but its dependency chain includes known-malware packages from the same namespace.",
